 F:	drivers/tty/serial/atmel_serial.c
 F:	drivers/tty/serial/atmel_serial.h
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/atmel-usart.txt
 
 MICROCHIP / ATMEL DMA DRIVER
