@@ -9192,6 +9193,14 @@ S:	Supported
 F:	drivers/mtd/nand/raw/atmel/*
 F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mtd/atmel-nand.txt
 
+MICROCHIP AT91 USART MFD DRIVER
